{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27915","headline":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 五 · 朱庆余","name":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴之什十首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深斋尝独处，讵肯厌秋声。\n翠筱寒愈静，孤花晚更明。\n每因逢石坐，多见抱书行。\n入夜听疎杵，遥知耿此情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}